  "content": "\n                        <div class=\"plugin-tabmeta-details\"><div class=\"table-wrap\"></div></div><h2 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-Goals\">Goals</h2><ul><li>The goal of backend management is the addition and removal of SCMS components</li><li>The provisioning and initial setup requirements for all backend components is defined in <a class=\"unresolved\" href=\"#\">Use Case 1: SCMS Component Setup</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-BackgroundandStrategicFit\">Background and Strategic Fit</h2><p>As the SCMS system evolves, it is necessary that SCMS components can be added and removed.</p><p>This includes Root <abbr title=\"Certificate Authority\">CAs</abbr>. For the <abbr title=\"Proof-Of-Concept\">POC</abbr>, there will be only one Root CA. To manage Roots CAs, (e.g., to add and remove them) the SCMS will employ a multi-Elector system. In this scheme, there are a number of electors. These entities are trust anchors but also vote to manage Root CAs, i.e., to remove or add a new Root CA. The SCMS Manager coordinates the electors. An operation on a Root CA (addition or revocation) will require a message signed by some given number of electors. The exact number of electors needed to perform addition or revocation is a fixed quorum <em>m</em>. The public keys of the electors will be installed into the trust stores of every SCMS component, including the <abbr title=\"Onboard Equipment\">OBE</abbr>s. In the PoC, electors will be implemented to be manual processes, and the Root Management messages signed by electors will be generated by manual means for testing the management of the Roots CAs.</p><h2 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-Assumptions\">Assumptions</h2><ul><li>SCMS components need to be added and revoked but not removed and rolled-over</li><li>More requirements specific to each operation and component will occur in the subsections</li></ul><h2 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-Requirements\"><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"b12ee319-dff3-4023-b660-cb91436e0786\"><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"489cb0a9-49a4-4623-a30b-d2dcf28be56a\"><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"beca46e4-8366-4aba-9700-07d75f0ec6a5\"></span></span></span></h2><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-0\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><p>\n\n\n\n\n\n    </p><div id=\"refresh-module-1658985873\" class=\"refresh-module-id jira-table\">\n    <p>\n        \n            \n        \n            \n\n    </p></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"></div></div><h2 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-Design\">Design</h2><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-B\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" alt=\"Diagram showing SCMS Architecture\" src=\"attachments/55247155/55247156.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/55247155/55247156.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"55247156\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"SCMS Overview v0.3.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"55247155\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"1\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>SCMS Architecture</strong></div></div><h2 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-SummaryShowingTrustAnchorRelationshipsOnly\">Summary Showing Trust Anchor Relationships Only</h2><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-C\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" alt=\"Diagram showing SCMS Root CA Trust Anchor Relationships\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427195.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427195.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427195\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 1 - Typical Condition - Summary.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>SCMS Root CA Trust Anchor Relationships - Overview</strong></div></div><h2 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-TypicalSCMSOperations\">Typical SCMS Operations</h2><h3 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-Day1:TypicalSCMSSystemOperations\">Day 1: Typical SCMS System Operations</h3><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-D\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"741\" width=\"992\" alt=\"Diagram showing SCMS Root CA and Elector Trust Relationships\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427196.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427196.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427196\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 1 - Typical Condition.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>SCMS Root CA &amp; Elector Trust Relationships</strong></div></div><h3 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-Scenario1:LifeCycleofElector(Level0)RevocationandReplacement\">Scenario 1: &nbsp;Life Cycle of Elector (Level 0) Revocation and Replacement</h3><p><strong>Scenario 1, Day 2: Process to Revoke an Elector while Maintaining Functionality</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-E\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"741\" width=\"1004\" alt=\"Diagram showing Elector A Revocation Process\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427197.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427197.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427197\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 2 - Revoke Level 0.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>Elector A Revocation Process</strong></div></div><p><strong>Scenario 1,&nbsp;Day 3: System Functional for Period of Time with Two Root Endorsers</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-F\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" alt=\"Diagram showing SCMS Operation with 2 Electors\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427198.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427198.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427198\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 3 - 2 components only Level 0.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>SCMS Operational with Electors B &amp; C Only</strong></div></div><p><strong>Scenario 1,&nbsp;Day 4: Introduction of Replacement Elector</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" alt=\"Diagram showing Introduction of a Replacement Elector\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427188.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427188.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427188\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 4 - Replacement Level 0.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>Introduce Elector D</strong></div></div><p><strong>Scenario 1,&nbsp;Day 5: Steady State Operations after the Introduction of Replacement Elector</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-G\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" alt=\"Diagram showing SCMS Trust Relationship with Elector D\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427189.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427189.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427189\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 5 - Steady State Level 0.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>SCMS Trust Relationships with Elector D</strong></div></div><h3 id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-Scenario2:LifeCycleofRootCA(Level1)RevocationandReplacement\">Scenario 2: &nbsp;Life Cycle of Root CA (Level 1) Revocation and Replacement</h3><p><span class=\"inline-comment-marker\" data-ref=\"5fccfbcf-a8cc-48a8-9c84-079cea529620\">&nbsp;</span><strong>Scenario 2,&nbsp;Day 2: Prepare New Root CA</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-H\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"734\" width=\"988\" alt=\"Diagram showing replacement root CA creation and distribution\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427194.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427194.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427194\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 2 - Level 1.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>Create Replacement Root CA &amp; Distribute to SCMS Servers</strong></div></div><p><strong>Scenario 2,&nbsp;Day 3: Generate New Certificates for all SCMS Components &amp; Distribute</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-I\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"644\" width=\"988\" alt=\"Diagram showing replacement of root CA\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427190.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427190.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427190\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 3 - Level 1.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>Introduce Replacement Root CA before Revoking Current Root CA</strong></div></div><p><strong>Scenario 2,&nbsp;Day 4: Revoke Root CA</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-J\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"735\" width=\"988\" alt=\"Diagram showing revokation of Root CA\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427192.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427192.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427192\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 4 - Level 1.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>Revoke Root CA</strong></div></div><p><strong>Scenario 2,&nbsp;Day 5: Condition of SCMS while Root CA is Revoked</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-K\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"734\" width=\"988\" alt=\"Diagram showing non-functional system with root revoked\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427193.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427193.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427193\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 5 - Level 1.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27427186\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"><strong>Root Revoked - System Non-functional</strong></div></div><p><strong>Scenario 2,&nbsp;Day 6: <abbr title=\"End Entities\">EEs</abbr> Updated with New Root Certificate, New Enrollment Certificate and New Pseudonym Certificates</strong></p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"UseCase11:BackendManagement-L\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"647\" width=\"988\" alt=\"Diagram showing updated EE with new certificates\" src=\"attachments/27427186/27427191.jpg\" data-image-src=\"attachments/27427186/27427191.jpg\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27427191\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Day 6 - Level 1.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"274271